      "en": "For the width of the court on the west side shall be hangings of fifty cubits; their pillars ten, and their sockets ten.",
      "ko": "뜰의 옆 곧 서편에 광 오십 규빗의 포장을 치되 그 기둥이 열이요 받침이 열이며",
      "source_text_hash": "785f3b6f57efc98bc4175c95a43f2478a1911d939f3757e7e5612b1e2e1229fe",
      "translation_text_hash": "6a3faa236d4bb426dbecde86765467f07869d8c44bb2ec0f80b69bb541b725da",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
